<title>NETHERLANDS: Amsterdam cocoa imports down in first quarter.</title>
<headline>Amsterdam cocoa imports down in first quarter.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Amsterdam port area imported some 20 percent less cocoa in the first quarter of the year compared to 1996, the port authority said.</p>
<p>Imports of cocoa beans totalled 168,376 tonnes and exports 1,030 tonnes, giving a total traffic figure of 169,406.</p>
<p>In the first quarter of 1996, bean imports were 211,278 tonnes and exports 168, giving a total of 211,446 tonnes.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam Newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
